{"title":"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given that a, b, and c are non-zero real numbers, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ff06fed70fd5b2f7f88c1e62e631f5707659fd7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b, c) = \\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{b}{c} + \\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"161\" height=\"37\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3ebc7325af4f1831e00aa2c54dea23ba6084c8f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 12, 9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/e/ccefe446ac26b1d2ff26fd59aaaea8ce281b5a83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/3923a8b8b7fc17a1c39e7603ce84b0dd905840c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 12, 9)=\\frac{2}{12}+\\frac{12}{9}+\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{4}{3}+\\frac{9}{2}=\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{8}{6}+\\frac{27}{6}=\\frac{36}{6}=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"497\" height=\"38\" />. Our answer is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394e31b6e19ba6e9c14f340669915c86d068a16a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Without computing the answer exactly, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0fcfc243f87bf536da606161ebd84bd6bd4bd59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/12=\\text{a little}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/6/7561279759aa9123f89e2cc01eae00fe9bf65dbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12/9=\\text{more than }1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d2a339e63348244e06c466735dea80d91cdffca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9/2=4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" />.\nThe sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef684f341e03d8868d567c5b98fa8810d1a697b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5 + (\\text{more than }1) + (\\text{a little}) = (\\text{more than }5.5) + (\\text{a little})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"458\" height=\"18\" />, and as all the options are integers, the correct one is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/4/394e31b6e19ba6e9c14f340669915c86d068a16a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/I1LoajlCAgg\">https://youtu.be/I1LoajlCAgg</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A\">2002 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/